      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "title": "Start here - generate from the Timeline app",
      "widgets_values": [
        "Three selectable REF2VA configurations\n\nA: PDD REF2VA - 8 steps. Existing PDD adapter, its exact SIGMAS output and Euler.\n\nB: Stock REF2VA - 30 steps. Existing editable comparison branch; not the standard 20-step base recipe. This branch is unchanged by the HyperFlow addition.\n\nC: HyperFlow REF2VA - 8 steps. Uses ApplyHyperFlowH3 from ComfyUI-HyperFlow-H3, its native 9-point SIGMAS and Euler. Model Attention Backend is applied AFTER HyperFlow. BasicScheduler and PDD are bypassed on this branch.\n\nThe shared default diffusion checkpoint is a full REF2VA model, so C selects custom_node_hyperflow_8step_v1.0_comfyui.safetensors. Strength 1.0, bypass, variant auto, downloads off, curve refit off. Select your installed converted HyperFlow node-build file under models/hyperflow. A generic standalone LoRA file is not interchangeable with this adapter.\n\nIf you replace the shared loader with a PRUNED model, change C to the _pruned adapter. Enable experimental_curve_refit only for a supported checkpoint-bound fit; name that experiment accordingly. See HYPERFLOW.md. No files are downloaded automatically.\n\nAll paths use video/audio shifts 12/3. HyperFlow reads the unpatched loader and produces its already shifted SIGMAS; do not add another scheduler or shift its SIGMAS again. CLIP and AV VAEs are shared.\n\nRestart ComfyUI after installing the node packs, load this workflow, then open Timeline from its ComfyUI button and keep that tab open. Choose Generation settings > Generation configuration > HyperFlow REF2VA - 8 steps.\n\nOnly the selected path is queued. Slots D-E remain free. No HyperFlow prompt timing skip, automatic last-frame image or additional overlap trim is added. Existing selected-take latent continuation stays unchanged.\n\nReferences only get aliases. Define subjects explicitly, e.g. <Subject 1> is the person in <picture.main>. Generate/review, then finalize, Extend scene or Replace tail segment as usual. Leave request_token blank; Timeline fills it."
      ]
    },
